!_______________________________________________________
! GIS
GIS Format == ${gis_format}
GRID Format == TIF
${gis_projection_command}

!_______________________________________________________
! SOLVER
Tutorial Model == OFF
Solution scheme == HPC
Hardware == GPU

!_______________________________________________________
! SGS SETTINGS
SGS == ON
SGS Sample Target Distance == <distance>  ! TODO update to appropriate value based on model cell size

!_______________________________________________________
! SCENARIOS / EVENTS
##IF module:events##
! Model event == <event_name>
! Model scenario == <scenario_name>
Event File == ..\model\${model_name}_events.tef
##ENDIF##
##IF not:module:events##
! Model event == <event_name>
! Model scenario == <scenario_name>
! Event File == ..\model\${model_name}_events.tef
##ENDIF##

!_______________________________________________________
! CONTROL FILES
Geometry Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.tgc
BC Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.tbc
BC Database == ..\bc_dbase\bc_dbase.csv
Read Materials File == ..\model\${model_name}_mat.csv
##IF module:estry##
Estry Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.ecf
##ENDIF##
##IF not:module:estry##
! Estry Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.ecf
##ENDIF##
##IF module:soils##
Read Soils File == ..\model\${model_name}_soils.tsoilf
##ENDIF##
##IF not:module:soils##
! Read Soils File == ..\model\${model_name}_soils.tsoilf
##ENDIF##
##IF module:quadtree##
Quadtree Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.qcf
##ENDIF##
##IF module:ad##
AD Control File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.adcf
##ENDIF##
##IF module:toc##
Read Operational Controls == ..\model\${model_name}.toc
##ENDIF##
##IF module:rf##
Read Rainfall File == ..\model\${model_name}_${iter}.rf
##ENDIF##
